  "description": "Full Suspension\nA responsive front suspension paired with a newly upgraded rear soft-tail system smooths out bumps and rough terrain for a more comfortable ride. The rear suspension is built to absorb strong impacts, such as hard landings, side hits, and rough terrain, keeping the frame stable, reducing wear, and making maintenance easier.\n2000W Motor Hub\nThunder Pro’s upgraded motor delivers 1200W of sustained power, peaking at 2000W, with an impressive 110 N·m of torque to take on steep climbs and rough terrain with ease. Accelerate from 0–20 mph in just 5 seconds, enjoying strong, responsive power that keeps every ride smooth, controlled, and effortlessly confident.\n52V/ 20Ah Battery\nEquipped with a 1040Wh battery, Thunder Pro delivers a top speed of 35 mph and a maximum range of up to 90 miles, making it ideal for long commutes or all-day adventures. With fast charging from 15% to 80% in just 5 hours, you spend less time waiting and more time riding. Go farther, ride faster, and enjoy every journey without limits.\nNew Upgrade- All-Terrain 20x4\" Tires\nThese puncture-resistant, durable 20\"x4\" fat tires make the adventure a no-brainer.",
